<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24450" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-saepĭo</span></b> , saepsi, saeptum,
		4, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To fence about</i>, <i>hedge in</i>,
				<i>stop up</i>, <i>enclose</i>, <i>secure</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foramina intersaepta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 1, 20, 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaedam operibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					34, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">muro intersaepta urbs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					31, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legionem densis arbustis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					3, 21</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To shut off</i>, <i>deprive of</i>,
				<i>take away</i>, <i>cut off</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">iter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Balb. 18, 43</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">itinera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 6,
					9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Amm. 14, 2, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vallo urbem ab arce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					25, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alicui conspectum abeuntis exercitus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1,
					27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incendio intersaepti ab hoste,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					42, 63</span></i>
			.</div>
